11047208,2024-12-05,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I, XXXX XXXX, have identified multiple violations of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and other consumer protection laws regarding how my personal and credit information has been handled. Specifically : Willful Noncompliance : Under 15 U.S.C. 1681n, credit information about me was accepted and reported without proper verification, demonstrating willful noncompliance with federal requirements. This has caused harm to my credit standing.

