11056180,2024-12-06,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Subject : Response to Inquiry Regarding Account Validation To Whom It May Concern, I am writing in response to your letter dated XX/XX/XXXX, regarding the referenced account allegedly acquired from XXXX XXXX. I appreciate your compliance with my previous cease and desist request but remain concerned about the insufficient validation provided to support your claim of ownership and my obligation to pay this debt. I HAVE NEVER AND DO NOT CONSENT TO DO BUSINESS WITH LVNV FUNDING LLC, NOR DID I CONSENT TO USE MY NAME AND PRIVATE INFORMATION, NOR DO I HAVE ANY CONTRACTS WITH SAID PARTY. 

