11336739,2024-12-31,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Dear Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ), I am writing to formally file a complaint against XXXX and the collection agencies they employ for repeatedly reporting a debt that I do not owe. This ongoing issue has caused significant damage to my credit score and financial stability. Despite my efforts to resolve the matter, XXXX and their associated collection agencies have failed to provide any proof of the alleged debt and continue to report inaccurate information to the credit bureaus. 

