My Efforts to Resolve the Issue Contacting XXXX : I reached out to XXXX to request details about the alleged account, including proof that it was created by me. Despite my requests, they have failed to provide any documentation or evidence linking me to this account. 

Dealing with Collection Agencies : Each time a collection entry appears, I dispute it with the credit bureaus. While the entries are temporarily removed, they resurface after several months, reported by a different agency. This cyclical process is unjust and harmful to my credit health. 

Inaccurate Reporting : I have never had an account with XXXX, nor have I used their services. The repeated reporting of this debt is not only inaccurate but also a violation of my consumer rights. 

Impact on My Life These unfounded collection entries have : Significantly lowered my credit score, affecting my ability to secure loans and financial products. 

Caused emotional distress due to the repeated need to dispute and monitor my credit report. 

Created undue financial pressure, as I am being held responsible for a debt I did not create. 

Request for Resolution I respectfully request the CFPBs assistance in the following : Investigate XXXX and Their Collection Agencies : Ensure they provide proof of the alleged debt or cease reporting it. 

Permanently Remove Inaccurate Entries : Require all credit bureaus to permanently remove any entries related to this unfounded debt from my credit report. 

Prevent Future Occurrences : Mandate XXXX and their collection agencies to stop assigning or reporting this alleged debt to any collection agency or credit bureau in the future. 

I have attached all relevant documentation, including copies of my credit reports, prior dispute letters, and correspondence with XXXX and the collection agencies. 

Thank you for your attention to this matter. I trust in the CFPBs commitment to protecting consumers from unfair and deceptive practices. Please let me know if you require any additional information or documentation.",,"EQUIFAX, INC.",CT,06516,,Web,2024-12-31,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes
